    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d223-a1">

                <pb facs="0324" n="218" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg218"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 222.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Capt. Schley to Mr. Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">U.
                                S. S. Baltimore</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps">First
                                Rate</hi>),<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Valparaiso</hi></placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November 3, 1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith my
                    letter to the intendente as suggested by you in accordance with your
                    instructions and my own upon that point.</p>
                <p>I inclose also a translation of the intendente’s reply.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. S. Schley</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Captain Commanding</hi>.</signed></closer>




